# COMMIT/IOERROR XA PREPARE and XA COMMIT: every injected failure was handled correctly
# COMMIT/IOERROR XA COMMIT ONE PHASE: every injected failure was handled correctly
# COMMIT/IOERROR XA PREPARE, XA COMMIT from another connection: every injected failure was handled correctly
